.TH "nvme_init_identify_supported_ctrl_state_formats" 9 "nvme_init_identify_supported_ctrl_state_formats" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_identify_supported_ctrl_state_formats \- Initialize passthru command for Supported Controller State Formats
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_identify_supported_ctrl_state_formats
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "struct nvme_supported_ctrl_state_formats *formats "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Command data structure to initialize
.IP "formats" 12
User space destination address to transfer the data
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Identify command with
CNS value NVME_IDENTIFY_CNS_SUPPORTED_CTRL_STATE_FORMATS.
